{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Outlaw Squadron",
    "steam_appid": 1650410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650410/extras/470df02def09348aaaf549016a480a3b.avif?t=1748954155\" /></div>Outlaw Squadron is a turn-based air combat game where speed and squadron tactics are the key to victory. Train your pilots, upgrade airplanes and build a legendary squadron to defeat your enemies. And remember: Never Leave Your Wingman!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn-Based Combat:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in thrilling dogfights where speed, maneuvers, and skills are crucial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize unique team tactics to multiply your damage and protect your airplanes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I Feel the Need... The Need for Speed!&quot;</strong>: Intuitive 'speed as a resource' mechanic. Faster flying enables skills, creating dynamic choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Never Leave Your Wingman!&quot;</strong>: Formation flying unlocks unique tactical abilities, defensive bonuses and combined attacks.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Autobattler Duels:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe how your skills perform in auto battler duels and refine your strategies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pilots: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect Squadron Leader or Wingman and become a Legendary Ace.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Airplanes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly legendary airplanes like Spitfire, Messerschmitt Bf 109, P-51 Mustang, I-16, Mitsubishi A6M Zero, Me 262 and many more.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650410/extras/470df02def09348aaaf549016a480a3b.avif?t=1748954155\" /></div>Outlaw Squadron is a turn-based air combat game where speed and squadron tactics are the key to victory. Train your pilots, upgrade airplanes and build a legendary squadron to defeat your enemies. And remember: Never Leave Your Wingman!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn-Based Combat:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in thrilling dogfights where speed, maneuvers, and skills are crucial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize unique team tactics to multiply your damage and protect your airplanes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I Feel the Need... The Need for Speed!&quot;</strong>: Intuitive 'speed as a resource' mechanic. Faster flying enables skills, creating dynamic choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Never Leave Your Wingman!&quot;</strong>: Formation flying unlocks unique tactical abilities, defensive bonuses and combined attacks.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Autobattler Duels:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe how your skills perform in auto battler duels and refine your strategies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pilots: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect Squadron Leader or Wingman and become a Legendary Ace.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Airplanes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly legendary airplanes like Spitfire, Messerschmitt Bf 109, P-51 Mustang, I-16, Mitsubishi A6M Zero, Me 262 and many more.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Outlaw Squadron is a turn-based air combat game where speed and squadron tactics are the key to victory. Train your pilots, upgrade airplanes and build a legendary squadron to defeat your enemies. And remember: Never Leave Your Wingman!",
